# AquaVision Root Environment Guide
# -------------------------------------------------------------
# AquaVision contains two sub-projects: backend/ and frontend/.
# Please refer to their individual environment templates:
#
# Backend Configuration:
#   See `backend/.env.example` -> copy to `backend/.env`
#   Default: HOST=0.0.0.0, PORT=8000, DEVICE=auto
#
# Frontend Configuration:
#   See `frontend/.env.example` -> copy to `frontend/.env.local`
#   Default: NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
# -------------------------------------------------------------
